=== bank comparison at q=2 (the extremal question) ===
  AP13            : W_2 formula = 0.0649, measured = 0.0649  (mu = 0.4425)
  GW              : W_2 formula = 0.0649, measured = 0.0794  (mu = 0.5884)
  parity record   : W_2 formula = 0.0649, measured = 0.0649  (mu = 0.5306)
  miss-2 (all odd): W_2 formula = 0.0714, measured = 0.0714  (mu = 0.4425)
  random          : W_2 formula = 0.0067, measured = 0.0990  (mu = 0.9937)

q=2 structure note: residues mod 2 split E into odd/even classes at x ~ p/2;
miss (all one parity) => G = 2, gap 1 - 1/7 huge => wide window; full => G = 1,
gap 1/2 - 1/7, drift = cross-parity edge rates. The extremal comparison is
(3/14)/D_AP vs family values -- printed above for the dichotomy check.
